{"category": "LocationDialogue Location17", "line_index": 0, "text": "// Player thinks"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location17", "line_index": 1, "text": "Здається, одному тут не впоратися."}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location17", "line_index": 2, "text": "Сподіваюся, тутешня Міта не кусається..."}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location17", "line_index": 3, "text": "// Coffee"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location17", "line_index": 4, "text": "На що я витрачаю час..."}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location17", "line_index": 5, "text": ""}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location17", "line_index": 6, "text": ""}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location17", "line_index": 7, "text": ""}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location17", "line_index": 8, "text": ""}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location17", "line_index": 9, "text": "// Player tries to wake up Mitu "}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location17", "line_index": 10, "text": "Міто? // Try 1"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location17", "line_index": 11, "text": "Міто, прокинься. // Try 2"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location17", "line_index": 12, "text": "Мі-іто. // Try 3"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location17", "line_index": 13, "text": ""}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location17", "line_index": 14, "text": "Міто, прокинься!"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location17", "line_index": 15, "text": "Мені потрібна твоя допомога."}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location17", "line_index": 16, "text": "// MitaDream"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location17", "line_index": 17, "text": "Ти хто-о?"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location17", "line_index": 18, "text": "// Player"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location17", "line_index": 19, "text": "Допоможи мені з важелем."}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location17", "line_index": 20, "text": "// MitaDream"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location17", "line_index": 21, "text": "Який ще важіль?"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location17", "line_index": 22, "text": "Дай поспати..."}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location17", "line_index": 23, "text": "Або завари мені кави."}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location17", "line_index": 24, "text": "// Player"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location17", "line_index": 25, "text": "Тут пройти два кроки..."}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location17", "line_index": 26, "text": "Міто?"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location17", "line_index": 27, "text": "Мі-іто!"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location17", "line_index": 28, "text": ""}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location17", "line_index": 29, "text": ""}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location17", "line_index": 30, "text": ""}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location17", "line_index": 31, "text": "// Player gives away the coffee"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location17", "line_index": 32, "text": "Міто,"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location17", "line_index": 33, "text": "Ось кава."}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location17", "line_index": 34, "text": ""}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location17", "line_index": 35, "text": ""}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location17", "line_index": 36, "text": ""}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location17", "line_index": 37, "text": "// MitaDream exercise"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location17", "line_index": 38, "text": "Так ти кажеш..."}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location17", "line_index": 39, "text": "Важелі?"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location17", "line_index": 40, "text": "// Player"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location17", "line_index": 41, "text": "Так."}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location17", "line_index": 42, "text": "// MitaDream"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location17", "line_index": 43, "text": "А звідки ти знаєш про них?"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location17", "line_index": 44, "text": "Хоча чого я питаю..."}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location17", "line_index": 45, "text": "Якщо ти тут,"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location17", "line_index": 46, "text": "Значить, ти вже багато чого знаєш..."}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location17", "line_index": 47, "text": ""}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location17", "line_index": 48, "text": "Стривай, "}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location17", "line_index": 49, "text": "Треба присісти."}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location17", "line_index": 50, "text": ""}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location17", "line_index": 51, "text": "Так, і?"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location17", "line_index": 52, "text": "// Player"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location17", "line_index": 53, "text": "Не знаю, що тобі сказати..."}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location17", "line_index": 54, "text": "Але мені потрібно пройти далі."}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location17", "line_index": 55, "text": "За маршрутом, який будує кільце..."}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location17", "line_index": 56, "text": "// MitaDream"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location17", "line_index": 57, "text": "У тебе її кільце?"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location17", "line_index": 58, "text": "Тоді зрозуміло,"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location17", "line_index": 59, "text": "Як ти сюди потрапив..."}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location17", "line_index": 60, "text": "// Player"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location17", "line_index": 61, "text": "Вірно."}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location17", "line_index": 62, "text": "То ти мені допоможеш?"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location17", "line_index": 63, "text": "З важелями?"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location17", "line_index": 64, "text": "// MitaDream"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location17", "line_index": 65, "text": "Звичайно. // Sle"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location17", "line_index": 66, "text": "Допоможу... // Slee"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location17", "line_index": 67, "text": "З важелями... // Sleep"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location17", "line_index": 68, "text": ""}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location17", "line_index": 69, "text": "// Player"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location17", "line_index": 70, "text": "Міто, знову?"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location17", "line_index": 71, "text": "Ходімо вже."}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location17", "line_index": 72, "text": "// MitaDream"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location17", "line_index": 73, "text": "Га?"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location17", "line_index": 74, "text": "Добре."}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location17", "line_index": 75, "text": "Ходімо."}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location17", "line_index": 76, "text": ""}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location17", "line_index": 77, "text": ""}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location17", "line_index": 78, "text": "// fall mitadream - Player"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location17", "line_index": 79, "text": "Вставай."}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location17", "line_index": 80, "text": "Тобі так сильно спати хочеться?"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location17", "line_index": 81, "text": ""}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location17", "line_index": 82, "text": "// again sleep mitadream - Player"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location17", "line_index": 83, "text": "Проки-инься."}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location17", "line_index": 84, "text": "Ми ж вже прийшли."}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location17", "line_index": 85, "text": ""}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location17", "line_index": 86, "text": "// Switches"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location17", "line_index": 87, "text": "// MitaDream"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location17", "line_index": 88, "text": "Добре,"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location17", "line_index": 89, "text": "Я готова."}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location17", "line_index": 90, "text": "// Player"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location17", "line_index": 91, "text": "Я теж готовий."}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location17", "line_index": 92, "text": "// MitaDream"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location17", "line_index": 93, "text": "Ну..."}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location17", "line_index": 94, "text": "Я почну"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location17", "line_index": 95, "text": "Відлік,"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location17", "line_index": 96, "text": "А потім разом смикнемо важелі."}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location17", "line_index": 97, "text": "До-бре? // slow sleep"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location17", "line_index": 98, "text": "// Player"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location17", "line_index": 99, "text": "Ти тільки не засни."}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location17", "line_index": 100, "text": "Починай відлік."}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location17", "line_index": 101, "text": ""}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location17", "line_index": 102, "text": "// MitaDream"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location17", "line_index": 103, "text": "3"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location17", "line_index": 104, "text": "2"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location17", "line_index": 105, "text": "1"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location17", "line_index": 106, "text": ""}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location17", "line_index": 107, "text": "// Player lose 1 - MitaDream"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location17", "line_index": 108, "text": "Ти чого?"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location17", "line_index": 109, "text": "Ну,"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location17", "line_index": 110, "text": "Давай ще раз."}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location17", "line_index": 111, "text": ""}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location17", "line_index": 112, "text": "// Player lose 2 - MitaDream"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location17", "line_index": 113, "text": "Знову?"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location17", "line_index": 114, "text": "Ще трохи,"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location17", "line_index": 115, "text": "І я "}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location17", "line_index": 116, "text": "Засну..."}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location17", "line_index": 117, "text": ""}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location17", "line_index": 118, "text": "// Player lose 3 - MitaDream"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location17", "line_index": 119, "text": "Зараз засну..."}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location17", "line_index": 120, "text": ""}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location17", "line_index": 121, "text": ""}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location17", "line_index": 122, "text": "// Player Win"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location17", "line_index": 123, "text": "Чудово."}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location17", "line_index": 124, "text": "Дякую, Міто."}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location17", "line_index": 125, "text": "// MitaDream"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location17", "line_index": 126, "text": "Угум."}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location17", "line_index": 127, "text": ""}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location17", "line_index": 128, "text": "// MitaDream"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location17", "line_index": 129, "text": "Такі..."}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location17", "line_index": 130, "text": "Повільні..."}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location17", "line_index": 131, "text": "Двері..."}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location17", "line_index": 132, "text": ""}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location17", "line_index": 133, "text": "// MitaDream"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location17", "line_index": 134, "text": "Я пішла спати..."}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location17", "line_index": 135, "text": ""}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location17", "line_index": 136, "text": "// Why kitchen? - MitaDream"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location17", "line_index": 137, "text": "Навіщо ми сюди прийшли?"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location17", "line_index": 138, "text": "Якщо я засну на холодній підлозі кухні,"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location17", "line_index": 139, "text": "То винен будеш ти."}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location17", "line_index": 140, "text": ""}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location17", "line_index": 141, "text": "// Why bathroom? - MitaDream"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location17", "line_index": 142, "text": "Не розумію..."}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location17", "line_index": 143, "text": "І які ж важелі ти тут хотів посмикати?"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location17", "line_index": 144, "text": ""}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location17", "line_index": 145, "text": "// Put button - Player"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location17", "line_index": 146, "text": "Нічого не сталося?"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location17", "line_index": 147, "text": "Навіщо тоді тут ця кнопка?"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location17", "line_index": 148, "text": ""}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location17", "line_index": 149, "text": "// Cofee - Player"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location17", "line_index": 150, "text": "Може ти ще кави поп'єш?"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location17", "line_index": 151, "text": "Зараз же знову заснеш."}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location17", "line_index": 152, "text": "// MitaDream"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location17", "line_index": 153, "text": "Що?"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location17", "line_index": 154, "text": "Ні-і-і."}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location17", "line_index": 155, "text": "А смак цієї кави жахливий..."}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location17", "line_index": 156, "text": "Я в повному порядку..."}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location17", "line_index": 157, "text": ""}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location17", "line_index": 158, "text": "// Button - Player"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location17", "line_index": 159, "text": "Міто? Кнопка не працює, чуєш?  "}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location17", "line_index": 160, "text": "Ау?"}
